#. module: sn_wsd_stock_report
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:sn_wsd_stock_report.action_sn_wsd_goods_receipt_detail
msgid ""
"Every receipt of the warehouses is listed here, with the vendor,\n"
"                the source document it comes from and the day it was completed."
msgstr ""
"仓库的每一次收货都列在此处，含供应商、来源单据以及完成日期。"

#. module: sn_wsd_stock_report
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:sn_wsd_stock_report.action_sn_wsd_putaway_detail
msgid ""
"Every storage of the warehouses is listed here: the operation\n"
"                that brings the inspected goods into the stock on a three-step\n"
"                reception."
msgstr ""
"仓库的每一次上架都列在此处：三步入库中把检验合格的物料移入库存的作业。"

