#. module: sn_wsd_stock_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_stock_report.field_stock_picking__x_reception_step
msgid ""
"Step of the reception this transfer performs: the receipt of the vendor "
"goods, the quality control that follows it on a three-step reception, or "
"their storage into the warehouse stock. A transfer of any other operation "
"reports no step."
msgstr ""
"本调拨执行的收货环节：供应商来料的收货、三步入库中随后的质量控制、或把物料上架到仓库库存。其它作业的调拨不标注环节。"

